+synthetic program is a strong continue; the industrial
+DrivAerML-to-new-geometry program is a major-revision project whose
+present checkpoints do not transfer. Freeze new industrial architecture
+arms. First repair the experiment substrate and test a conservative,
+full-cover boundary representation.
+
+This review audits the code at local commit
